      "side": 1,
      "message": "Short answer - we need both\n\nThe module psuedo code is this:\n\n walt_init()\n {\n     if (atomic_cmpxchg(\u0026already_inited, 0, 1))\n                return;\n\n     /* rest of the initialization */\n }\n\n walt_probe()\n {\n       register_trace_android_vh_update_topology_flags_workfn(\n                        walt_init, NULL);\n\n        if (topology_update_done) {\n                walt_init();\n        }\n }\n\n\nw/o the hook we will need to do some looping around topology_update_done and sleep if its not yet set. It will cause us to loose time sleeping when walt features are required early in the boot phase.\n\n walt_probe() \n {\n    while (true) {\n             if (topology_upate_done) {\n                    walt_init()\n                    break;\n             } else {\n                 sleep (XmS);\n             }\n \n   }  \n }",
      "parentUuid": "638684f3_9aeebf69",
      "revId": "d3470e2313279f0de38391d1685b8731bb1a0c4a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
