      "writtenOn": "2021-05-07T19:42:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is all to handle a race between walt_probe() and update_topology_flags_workfn(). Is there a way to make the ordering deterministic instead? Is this a race between the loading of two modules -- can a dependency be expressed that will guarantee that one or the other always occurs first?",
      "parentUuid": "eadad440_38eb6346",
      "revId": "d3470e2313279f0de38391d1685b8731bb1a0c4a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
