      "writtenOn": "2021-05-10T19:16:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is a bit involved:\n\nThe cpufreq driver has to probe and it has other dependencies on clks and regulators.  Its probe order is non deterministic.\n\nwalt doesnt probe - has no devices. walt_init() needs to wait for update_topology_flags_workfn().\n\n\nupdate_topology_flags_workfn() gets called (in an asynchronous work) when cpufreq driver has probed and instantiated all the policies. Highlight \"asynchronous\" - so even if walt were to somehow init() right after the cpufreq driver is done, update_topology_flags_workfn() may not have completed.",
      "parentUuid": "33e8b75a_1e587d5d",
      "revId": "d3470e2313279f0de38391d1685b8731bb1a0c4a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
